# Story page: nm-inferno
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Firestorm
---
The Furnace was no longer on fire. The Furnace was fire, a distinction that matters a great deal if you happen to be standing in it.

{name} blazed through the storm faster than fear, singed and grinning, and I found the grin far more alarming than the fire.

The scales in the flames glowed like letters, and the letters spelled a name, and the name was {name}. I would prefer you did not read ahead. You will anyway.
